IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-NANOFLOW-PIPELINE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-OPS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SUB-SLICE-FACTOR    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NANO-BATCH-SIZE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 OVERLAPPED-OPS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-NANOFLOW.
    IF SUB-SLICE-FACTOR == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE NANO-BATCH-SIZE = TOTAL-OPS / SUB-SLICE-FACTOR.
    IF NANO-BATCH-SIZE == 0
        MOVE 1 TO NANO-BATCH-SIZE.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE OVERLAPPED-OPS = SUB-SLICE-FACTOR * 2.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 OVERLAPPED-OPS.
    WEIGHT 30 NANO-BATCH-SIZE.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
